{"about_the_game":"Do you want to create your dream Sim Racing setup? With the Sim Racing DLC, it\u2019s finally possible! You can create any setup you want. Any size, any color combination, any budget - from casual to full professional rigs - it\u2019s all up to you.<br><br>Try all 73 new items and create your dream Sim Racing Setup. Why not make a full-blown sim rig in your bedroom? Combine DLC furniture with default one to achive best looking room and let your imagination run wild. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131550/extras/15846853e5c8f31d8035a5dd7ab88b81.poster.avif?t=1761831369\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131550/extras/15846853e5c8f31d8035a5dd7ab88b81.webm?t=1761831369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131550/extras/15846853e5c8f31d8035a5dd7ab88b81.mp4?t=1761831369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Give your room a special touch with new items and turn it into a dream environment.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Sim Racing DLC contains:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>73 new items.<br></li><li>Racing seats, wheels, pedals, and monitors.<br></li><li>Custom rigs, LED lighting and other accessories to make your setup feel truly professional.<br></li><li>Flight controllers, flight bases and other flight sim accesories </li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4131550?t=1761831369","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4131550?t=1761831369","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131550/9d6aa0e29af173fdfda612d02251f87ff094cdfd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761831369","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/